tools.description:
Manually trigger a consolidation cycle — slice the live KG and snapshot it.

    Slice kinds:
    - topic: params={entity_type, canonical_name, hops?}
    - time_window: params={from, to}  (ISO-8601 datetime strings)
    - user_attention: params={user_id, days?}


Long-running: this starts an operation and waits a few seconds. If it finished you get the result; if not you get a handle {op_id, status, poll} -- call noo_op_status with that op_id (wait up to 25 seconds per call) until status is succeeded or failed. noo_op_cancel stops the gateway-side wait (the worker run itself may continue).

